The '''Kaaga Run'''<ref name="Guide">{{SWYouTube|series=Star Wars: Galaxy Guide|text=Meet the Hutts: The Galaxy's Biggest Crime Lords|video=Ct977noXUVg}}</ref> was a [[hyperlane]] that ran through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], linking [[Bothawui]] in [[Bothan Space]] to [[Circumtore]] in [[Hutt Space]]. Both endpoints were the junction of numerous [[hyperspace route]]s. The route ran from Bothawui northeast to [[Kupoh]],<ref name="Map" /> [[Klynan]], and then [[Nar Kaaga]] on the edge of Hutt Space, before running north and ending at Circumtore.<ref name="AVG" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Kaaga Run]], and was first mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

